  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Basel Framework: CRE22.49 rating bands",
      "summary": "The CRE22.49 haircut table names P-3 but omits Moody's P-1 and P-2, although P-3 and better short-term paper is eligible collateral.",
      "impact": "Position: Collateral C = 100 of CP of a corporate rated P-1 by Moody's, residual maturity 0.5 year, rated jurisdiction, exposure E = 100 cash. Reading a: P-1 equals A-1: Hc = 1% -> E* = 100 - 99 = 1 Reading b: P-1 not listed: no row, collateral not recognised (or second band 2% -> E* = 2) Difference: E* 1 vs 100 (or 2)",
      "correction": "Clarify or correct the cited passage so that the rule and its references give one result for the stated case."
    }
  },
